## FastStrat Backend – Project Structure Guide

- **Main entry**: [main.py](mdc:main.py)
  - Creates the FastAPI `app` and registers routers.
  - Included routers:
    - [routes/users.py](mdc:routes/users.py) (`users_router`)
    - [routes/plans.py](mdc:routes/plans.py) (`plans_router`)
    - [routes/admin_users.py](mdc:routes/admin_users.py) (`admin_router`)
    - [routes/agencies.py](mdc:routes/agencies.py) (`agencies_router`)
    - [routes/payments.py](mdc:routes/payments.py) (`payments_router`)
    - [routes/dashboard.py](mdc:routes/dashboard.py) (`dashboard_router`)
    - [routes/crm/zoho/zoho.py](mdc:routes/crm/zoho/zoho.py)
    - [routes/test_plan_update.py](mdc:routes/test_plan_update.py)

- **Payments (Stripe)**:
  - Additional Stripe endpoints under [routes/payments/stripe.py](mdc:routes/payments/stripe.py) (prefix `/stripe`).

- **Notable built-in endpoints** (in [main.py](mdc:main.py)):
  - `GET /init`, `GET /question`, `GET /answer`, `GET /research`
  - Content/Image: `/content_generation`, `/imagen_generate`, `/imagen_simple`, `/content_with_image`
  - PDFs/Reports: `GET /download-research-pdf/{session_id}/{task_name}`, `GET /list-research-pdfs/{session_id}`

- **Run locally**:
  - `uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000`
  - Container entry uses Uvicorn; see [Dockerfile](mdc:Dockerfile)

- **Add a new endpoint**:
  - Create an `APIRouter` in `routes/<module>.py` and include it from [main.py](mdc:main.py).
  - Use consistent `tags` and `prefix`.
  - Protect routes with permissions (see Permissions rule).

- **Key layers and locations**:
  - Services/business logic: [services/](mdc:services/__init__.py)
  - Data models/enums/config: [database/](mdc:database/README.md)
  - Integrations: [integrations/](mdc:integrations/zapier/README.md)
  - API routes: [routes/](mdc:routes/docs/README.md)

